# lazarus — Lazarus Mail Client

## Identity
- **Name**: Lazarus — a fork of [Dodo](https://github.com/akissinger/dodo) by Aleks Kissinger
- **Package**: `lazarus-mail`
- **Original Author**: Aleks Kissinger <aleks0@gmail.com>
- **Fork Maintainer**: Ruly Tafzil
- **License**: GPLv3
- **Local dir**: `~/Projects/lazarus`
- **Forgejo**: `ssh://forgejo@forge.rulytafzil.com:2222/Home/lazarus.git`
- **CLI**: `lazarus`
- **Config**: `~/.config/lazarus/config.py`
- **Install**: `pipx install -e ~/Projects/lazarus` (editable)

## What It Is
A graphical, keyboard-driven email client in Python/PyQt6 built on the
[notmuch](https://notmuchmail.org/) indexer.  Vim-like keychords, split-pane
layout with a persistent thread preview, and a built-in rich-text compose editor.
All operations go through notmuch tags — no email is ever lost.

## Architecture

### Split-Pane Layout
```
┌──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ MainWindow (QSplitter)                                   │
│ ┌──────────────────────┐ ┌─────────────────────────────┐ │
│ │ QTabWidget           │ │ Thread Preview (persistent) │ │
│ │  ├─ SearchPanel      │ │ ThreadPanel                 │ │
│ │  ├─ ComposePanel     │ │  (message list + viewer)    │ │
│ │  └─ TagPanel         │ │                             │ │
│ └──────────────────────┘ └─────────────────────────────┘ │
│ CommandBar / StatusBar                                    │
└──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```
- Thread preview always visible; position configurable (right/left/below/above)
- `Enter` on a thread → opens in preview pane (no thread tabs)
- `Escape` in preview → focus back to list
- `h`/`l` navigate list tabs; `j`/`k` navigate threads; `J`/`K` navigate messages
- `j`/`k` auto-opens selected thread after 150 ms debounce

### Class Hierarchy
```
QApplication
 └── Dodo (app.py)
      ├── Global commands (open/close panels, sync, search/tag bars)
      ├── SyncMailThread (mbsync + notmuch new with live progress)
      └── Delegation (navigate_list, mark_and_advance, delegate_to_list/thread)

QMainWindow
 └── MainWindow (mainwindow.py)
      ├── QSplitter ──┬── QTabWidget (list tabs)
      │               └── QStackedWidget (thread preview + placeholder)
      ├── CommandBar (commandbar.py)
      └── StatusBar (QLabel with auto-hide timer)

Panel(QWidget) — base class for all views
 ├── SearchPanel (search.py)    — notmuch query results; MarkableActionsMixin
 ├── ThreadPanel (thread.py)    — message viewer, double-buffered QWebEngineView
 ├── ComposePanel (compose.py)  — compose/reply/forward with built-in editor
 └── TagPanel (tag.py)          — tag browser with counts

Supporting models:
 ├── SearchModel(QAbstractItemModel)   — wraps notmuch search JSON
 ├── ThreadModel(QAbstractItemModel)   — thread tree, message access, tagging
 └── TagModel(QAbstractItemModel)      — tag list with unread/total counts
```

### Data Flow
```
Search:   notmuch search --format=json → SearchModel → QTreeView (5 cols)
Thread:   notmuch show --format=json   → ThreadModel  → QTreeView + QWebEngineView
Compose:  ComposeData → RichTextEditor → mime_builder  → SendmailThread → msmtp
Sync:     mbsync -a -V → SyncMailThread.progress → status bar → notmuch new
Delete:   d → +trash tag → move files to [Gmail]/Trash → d d to expunge
Archive:  A → -inbox -unread → move files to ~/Mail/Archive
Filters:  C-r → rules.apply_rules(settings.filter_rules, scope_query)
```

