## Icons & Desktop Integration

### Window Icon
Uses ``QIcon.fromTheme('lazarus')`` first (XDG hicolor lookup in
``~/.local/share/icons/``), with a bundled 1024px PNG fallback shipped as
``package_data``.  The original ``lazarus.svg`` was removed; all sizes come
from the hicolor PNG set.

### Desktop Entry
Run ``lazarus --install-desktop`` once to copy the ``.desktop`` file into
``~/.local/share/applications/`` and the hicolor icons (16–1024 px) into
``~/.local/share/icons/hicolor/``.  This is a one-shot explicit step — pipx
cannot install desktop files or icons automatically.  System packaging later
will use the existing ``data_files`` in ``setup.py``.

## Key Bindings

All keys work globally regardless of focus — the `global_keymap` delegates to either
the list panel or the thread preview directly.

### Navigation (always available)
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `j` / `k` / `↓` / `↑` | Next/previous thread |
| `<tab>` / `S-<tab>` | Next/previous unread thread |
| `J` / `K` | Next/previous message in thread |
| `g g` / `G` | First/last thread |
| `C-d` / `C-u` | Page down/up |
| `<pageup>` / `<pagedown>` | Page up/down (list) |
| `<space>` / `-` | Page down/up (message) |
| `<enter>` | Open/focus thread preview |
| `<escape>` | Focus back to list |
| `C-<enter>` | Close thread preview |
| `h` / `l` | Previous/next tab |
| `x` / `X` | Close panel / close all |

### Actions
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `s` | Mark thread and advance |
| `a` | Archive (current or all marked) |
| `d` | Delete to trash (current or all marked) |
| `d d` | Empty trash (irreversible expunge) |
| `d u` | Restore from trash |
| `A` | Archive to local Maildir |
| `u` / `f` | Toggle unread/flagged |
| `t t` | Tag current thread |
| `t m` | Tag all marked threads |
| `1`–`9` | Toggle configured tag hotkey |

### Navigation & Views
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `?` | Help (three-column layout) |
| `c` | Compose new message |
| `I` / `U` / `F` / `D` | Show inbox / unread / flagged / inbox |
| `T` | Tag browser |
| `/` | Search bar |
| `C-/` | Edit current tab's query in-place |
| `` ` `` | Manual sync |
| `C-r` | Apply filter rules |
| `Q` | Quit |

### Thread View
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `H` | Toggle HTML/plaintext |
| `i` | Toggle remote images |
| `M` | Toggle thread list mode (conversation ↔ tree) |
| `r` / `R` | Reply all / reply |
| `C-f` | Forward |
| `O` | Open attachments |

### Compose
| Key | Action |
|-----|--------|
| `<escape>` | Toggle focus (editor ↔ panel chrome) |
| `E` | Edit in external editor |
| `C-s` | Send |
| `a` | Attach file |
| `[` / `]` | Previous/next SMTP account |
| `p` / `e` | Toggle PGP sign/encrypt |

## Configuration

Config is a Python file at `~/.config/lazarus/config.py` that is `exec()`'d at
startup.  All settings live in `lazarus.settings` with documented defaults.

### Required Settings
| Setting | Purpose |
|---------|---------|
| `email_address` | Your email (string or `{account: address}` dict) |
| `sent_dir` | Where to store sent mail (string or `{account: dir}` dict) |

### Key Optional Settings
| Setting | Default | Purpose |
|---------|---------|---------|
| `theme` | `themes.nord` | Color theme |
| `sync_mail_command` | `'offlineimap'` | IMAP sync command |
| `sync_mail_interval` | `300` | Auto-sync interval in seconds (−1 to disable) |
| `send_mail_command` | `'msmtp -a "{account}" -t'` | SMTP send command |
| `smtp_accounts` | `['default']` | Account names for switching |
| `editor_command` | `'xterm -e vim {file}'` | External editor |
| `init_queries` | `['tag:inbox']` | Non-closable tabs at startup |
| `mail_root` | `'~/Mail'` | Local Maildir root |
| `archive_dir` | `'~/Mail/Archive'` | Local archive destination |
| `thread_pane_position` | `'right'` | Thread preview placement |
| `force_dark_mode` | `True` | Chromium dark mode flag |
| `filter_rules` | `[]` | List of `Rule` dataclasses |
| `filter_scope_query` | `'tag:inbox and tag:unread'` | Scope limit for filter rules |
| `tag_hotkeys` | `{}` | `{'1': 'Urgent', ...}` number-key mappings |
| `tag_order` | `['marked','Urgent',...]` | Tag display order |
| `log_level` | `'WARNING'` | Python logging level |
| `log_file` | `''` | Optional log file path |
| `html_confirm_open_links` | `True` | Confirm before opening browser |
| `use_signature` | `True` | Enable per-account signatures |

### Per-Account Signatures
Loaded from `~/.config/lazarus/<account>/signature` (plain text) and
`signature.html` (HTML, optional).  Swapped automatically when cycling accounts.

